- Repeating work only through NxPerf.timer("<feature>", delayTicks, periodTicks, () -> { ... }) (not runTaskTimer or BukkitRunnable.runTaskTimer, also not for an autosave or a countdown; keep the returned NxPerf.Timer, it has cancel()); one-off delays (runTaskLater) are fine; period 10 ticks or more unless the request needs a smoother effect (then very little work per run). Nothing heavy every tick.
